note The forest the vertical passes walk: a path step hangs off its parent step on the right, an expanded node off the node that revealed it, left for callers and right for callees. Each parent's right children are sorted by the line of its code that names them (Built::call_line), so siblings sit in call order and the step order breaks ties; the roots are the nodes with no parent, in step order.

