note One function, four passes over the nodes grouped by rank: columns, the forest, block heights, positions, then the collision sweep. It reads the sizes Built::measure wrote just before it and writes one CellPoint per node into position. Roots are stacked in step order with a double GRAPH_GAP_DOWN between them.

